 ## 2026-03-14 Upload size limit
 Decision: an upload may be at most 50 MB. Why: the print RIP rejects bigger files anyway.
+
+## 2026-10-26 What purgeOldUploads deletes
+Decision: an upload is old after 180 days; purgeOldUploads deletes old uploads that no order uses, record and file, and
+keeps the design file of every order. Why: the ticket did not say how old "old" is; docs/retention.md keeps an order and
+its design file together for 10 years.
